# 二进制文件：禁止 diff / merge / 文本过滤
# ============================================================
# 🔴 2026-09-20：本文件是**补的**。此前仓库缺失它，两个二进制文件已被 CRLF 归一化损坏：
#   · data/usst_articles.db —— SQLite 报 "database disk image is malformed"（任何人 clone 都拿不到可用语料）
#   · e2e/smoke.spec.ts-snapshots/entry-chromium-win32.png —— Playwright 报 "Could not decode expected image as PNG"
# 症状特征：文件头签名仍合法（PNG 的 89 50 4E 47 / SQLite 的 "SQLite format 3"），
#          但内容被换行替换过 → 压缩流/页结构损坏。加本文件后 git 侧不再做任何换行处理；
#          另注意工具侧（`_gh_api_push.py::read_lf`）也已修正为对二进制原样上传。
#
# `binary` 是 git 内置宏 = `-diff -merge -text`，比逐项写三个属性更不易漏。
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.avif  binary
*.bmp   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.zip   binary
*.gz    binary
*.7z    binary
*.db    binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.eot   binary
*.mp3   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.webm  binary
*.wav   binary
*.wasm  binary
